  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" class="sqsrte-large" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Every year we ask the same simple question - <em>how long would it take a hacker to crack your password</em> - and every year the answer gets a little shorter. Not because your password changed, but because the computers doing the work keep getting faster, cheaper to rent, and easier to configure.</p><p style="white-space:pre-wrap;" class="sqsrte-large" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>The 2026 Hive Systems Password Table is here.</strong></p><h4 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><span class="sqsrte-text-color--accent"><strong>Prefer a quick video breakdown instead?</strong></span></h4><p class="sqsrte-large" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Tune in later this month for our Hive Live episode breakdown!</p></div>


  
