            <div class="image-caption"><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>The count of whole password datasets breached at businesses and organizations, colored by hash type. </em><strong><em>Data from </em></strong><a href="http://www.haveibeenpwned.com"><strong><em>www.haveibeenpwned.com</em></strong></a></p></div>
