</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/3b0b5a8a-208b-40d1-bef1-de7bfc165cc2_1134/website.components.spacer.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/3b0b5a8a-208b-40d1-bef1-de7bfc165cc2_1134/website.components.spacer.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.spacer" data-website-component-id="4efd5043af3cda4d8ef6" id="block-4efd5043af3cda4d8ef6"><div class="sqs-block-content">&nbsp;</div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/31b4e3a9-f074-411d-ae8f-0cd820aa59c6_811/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]" data-block-scripts="[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/31b4e3a9-f074-411d-ae8f-0cd820aa59c6_811/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]" data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="667a38b916ec638067ff" id="block-667a38b916ec638067ff"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">
  
  <div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h3 style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true"><strong>“Ok but what’s the deal with these huge numbers?”</strong></h3><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;" data-rte-preserve-empty="true">Different countries, regions, and schools of thought abbreviate big numbers differently. The Password Table uses these:</p></div>


  
